[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H  \u001b[32mok\u001b[39m  codex-hooks: all five cxpeer hooks present with a valid interpreter                      \r\n  \u001b[32mok\u001b[39m  codex-trust: all five hooks trusted in config.toml                                       \r\n  \u001b[32mok\u001b[39m  codex-skill: /Users/hivamoh/.codex/skills/cxpeer/SKILL.md up to date                     \u001b[4;95H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[32mok\u001b[39m  tmux: present\r\n  \u001b[32mok\u001b[39m  self-test: bridge answered ping and queued a message in 1487 ms                          \r\n  \u001b[32mok\u001b[39m  live-bridges: (2 other bridges on this machine omitted)                                  \u001b[7;95H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m✓ ok\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2m2.1 s\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[8;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\r\n── step 2 of 6 · Start a Codex peer from a Claude session \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────\u001b[39m       \u001b[2m\r\n$ \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[33mcxpeer spawn codex --peer-name codex-journey-26dc --prompt 'Say READY and nothing else.' --wa\u001b[39m\u001b[11;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[33m\rit\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\r\n  starts codex in tmux, clicks through its prompts, "]
[0.000, "o", "waits until the peer is registered\u001b[m\u000f         \r\n  started cx-codex-cxpeer-15f2 (codex) in /Users/hivamoh/funProjects/cxpeer; attach with: tmux \u001b[14;95H\u001b[1K\rattach -t cx-codex-cxpeer-15f2\r\n  peer codex-journey-26dc is up (thread 01a081aa-13e2-7b42-94ed-cff214be3473); attach with: tmu\u001b[16;95H\u001b[1K\rx attach -t cx-codex-cxpeer-15f2\u001b[17;95H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m✓ ok\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2m3.2 s\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[18;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\r\n── step 3 of 6 · Claude sees the new peer \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m       \u001b[20;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\r$ \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[33mcxpeer list\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\r\n  the same list a Claude session gets from ListAgents\u001b[m\u000f                                          \r\n  claude-journey [024c76]  idle  /Users/hivamoh/funProjects/cxpeer                             \u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n  codex-journey-26dc [a571e8]  idle  /Users/hivamoh/funProjects/cxpeer\u001b[m\u000f                         \r\n  (8 other live sessions on this machine omitted)           "]
[0.000, "o", "                                   \u001b[25;95H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m✓ ok\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2m0.2 s\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[26;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\r\n── step 4 of 6 · Claude gives Codex a real task \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[36m────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m       \u001b[35m\r\n→ \u001b[1mto codex-journey-26dc: \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[35m\"List the three largest source files under cxpeer/ with their line cou\u001b[39m\u001b[29;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[35m\rnts, one line each.\"\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\r\n  auth line + message on the bridge socket, plus an idle subscription\u001b[m\u000f                          \u001b[31;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\r← \u001b[1manswer \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[2m(+18.5 s)\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[32;95H\u001b[1K\r  cxpeer/bridge.py: 585 lines\u001b[33;95H\u001b[1K\r  cxpeer/doctor.py: 347 lines\u001b[34;95H\u001b[1K\r  cxpeer/client.py: 246 lines\u001b[35;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\r← \u001b[1midle notice \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[2m(+18.6 s)\u001b[m\u000f\r\n  cxpeer/bridge.py: 585 lines cxpeer/doctor.py: 347 lines cxpeer/client.py: 246 lines          \u001b[37;95H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m✓ ok\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2m18.7 s\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[38;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\r\n── step 5 of 6 · Codex reaches out on its"]
[0.000, "o", " own \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m       \u001b[35m\r\n→ \u001b[1mto codex-journey-26dc: \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[35m\"Run `cxpeer send --to claude-journey \"hello from inside the Codex san\u001b[39m\u001b[41;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[35m\rdbox\"` and reply with its exit code.\"\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\r\n  Codex's sandbox blocks sockets, so its cxpeer send goes through a file outbox the bridge poll\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[43;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\rs\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[44;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\r← \u001b[1mfrom Codex, via cxpeer send \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[2m(+7.3 s)\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[45;95H\u001b[1K\r  hello from inside the Codex sandbox\u001b[46;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[34h\u001b[?25h\r"]
