[0.000, "o", "─────────────────────────\u001b[39m       \u001b[35m\r\n→ \u001b[1mto codex-journey-26dc: \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[35m\"List the three largest source files under cxpeer/ with their line cou\u001b[39m\u001b[27;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[35m\rnts, one line each.\"\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\r\n  auth line + message on the bridge socket, plus an idle subscription\u001b[m\u000f                          \u001b[29;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\r← \u001b[1manswer \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[2m(+18.5 s)\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[30;95H\u001b[1K\r  cxpeer/bridge.py: 585 lines\u001b[31;95H\u001b[1K\r  cxpeer/doctor.py: 347 lines\u001b[32;95H\u001b[1K\r  cxpeer/client.py: 246 lines\u001b[33;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\r← \u001b[1midle notice \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[2m(+18.6 s)\u001b[m\u000f\r\n  cxpeer/bridge.py: 585 lines cxpeer/doctor.py: 347 lines cxpeer/client.py: 246 lines          \u001b[35;95H\u001b[1K\r  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m✓ ok\u001b[m\u000f \u001b[2m18.7 s\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[36;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[36m\u001b[1m\r\n── step 5 of 6 · Codex reaches out on its own \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[36m──────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m       \u001b[35m\r\n→ \u001b[1mto codex-journey-26dc: \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[35m\"Run `cxpeer sen"]
[0.000, "o", "d --to claude-journey \"hello from inside the Codex san\u001b[39m\u001b[39;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[35m\rdbox\"` and reply with its exit code.\"\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\r\n  Codex's sandbox blocks sockets, so its cxpeer send goes through a file outbox the bridge poll\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[41;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\rs\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[42;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\r← \u001b[1mfrom Codex, via cxpeer send \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[2m(+7.3 s)\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[43;95H\u001b[1K\r  hello from inside the Codex sandbox\u001b[44;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\r← \u001b[1manswer \u001b[m\u000f\u001b[2m(+9.4 s)\u001b[m\u000f\u001b[45;95H\u001b[1K\r  Exit code: 0\u001b[46;95H\u001b[1K\u001b[34h\u001b[?25h\r"]
